line = 188
class = "test-gap"
severity = "medium"
observed = "The only head-read test prefunds two accounts and asserts a 503 principal_state_proof_unavailable response. It does not perform the transfer or verify a resulting head against the emulator public key, so it does not establish the positive behavior required by acceptance 8544.2."
expected = "Requirement 8544.2 requires a prefunded transfer followed by successful verification of its emulator head proof. A negative no-batch test is useful but cannot establish that positive producer-to-verifier path."
proposal = "Preserve the unavailable-head regression and add the positive committed-transfer proof path through the supported merged emulator interface and real verifier. If no such emulator capability remains after retirement, reconcile the requirement explicitly and retire the obsolete promise rather than weakening its test."
